   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nutip activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to a sustainable business network platform for Dutch and Ugandan businesses. It complements the Dutch Aid, Trade and Investment Agenda in Uganda.The East African Market, specifically Uganda, provides good opportunities for Dutch private sector companies to expand in various sectors such as Agribusiness throughout the value chain and tourism. Ugandan companies can profit from export opportunities to the Netherlands and can attract capital from interested Dutch investors.</narrative>
  </description>
